<h1>About castlink</h1>

<p>
    castlink is a "six degrees of separation" game for movies — given two actors, find the
    shortest chain of shared films connecting them, à la Six Degrees of Kevin Bacon. It's a
    portfolio project; the full architecture and phased build plan live in
    <code>docs/PLAN.md</code> in the repository.
</p>

